{"kosa": [{"id": "koSa", "headword": "कोश", "headword_slp1": "koSa", "fold": "kosa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "को॑श m. (n., L.; in class. literature कोश, or कोष; fr. √ कुश् or कुष्?, related to कुक्षि॑ and कोष्ठ?), a cask, vessel for holding liquids, (metaphorically) cloud, RV.; AV.; Suśr.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a pail, bucket, RV.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a drinking-vessel, cup, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a box, cupboard, drawer, trunk, RV. vi, 47, 23; AV. xix, 72, 1; ŚBr.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the interior or inner part of a carriage, RV.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(ifc.), MBh. viii, 1733", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a sheath, scabbard, &c., MBh.; R.; VarBṛS.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a case, covering, cover, AV.; ChUp.; MuṇḍUp.; TUp.; PārGṛ.; BhP.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "store-room, store, provisions, Mn.; MBh. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a treasury, apartment where money or plate is kept, treasure, accumulated wealth (gold or silver, wrought or unwrought, as plate, jewellery, &c.), ib.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(in surg.) a kind of bandage, Suśr.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a dictionary, lexicon or vocabulary", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a poetical collection, collection of sentences &c., Kāvyād. i, 13; Sāh.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a bud, flower-cup, seed-vessel (cf. बीज-), R.; Ragh.; BhP.; Dhūrtas.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the sheath or integument of a plant, pod, nut-shell, MārkP.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a nutmeg, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the inner part of the fruit of Artocarpus integrifolia and of similar fruits, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the cocoon of a silk-worm, Yājñ. iii, 147; Vedāntas.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "the membrane covering an egg (in the womb), Suśr.; VarBṛ.; MārkP.", 